        <presentation>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;Case Study #1: The Poisoning of a Politician&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id="yui_3_17_2_1_1607452711375_239"&gt;&lt;em id="yui_3_17_2_1_1607452711375_238"&gt;Use the following information to answer the next question.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Various Dioxin Poisoning Symptoms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cancer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nausea&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diabetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vomiting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heart disease&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liver damage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abdominal pain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Swollen pancreas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p id="yui_3_17_2_1_1607452711375_243"&gt;Some of the long-term effects that Viktor Yushchenko could suffer from because of the dioxin he ingested, include:&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
